{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c25aa7dd-8e59-8ac5-9c0f-5c6eb6eb30d8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:53:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Nancy Sherman. I am calling about a stray dog that has been roaming my street for two days now, and I am rather concerned. Kindly tell me whom I should speak with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mrs. Sherman, animal control takes those. I can take the details and pass them along. What does the dog look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He is a large dog, I would say about the size of a Labrador, perhaps sixty or seventy pounds. He is a tawny sort of brown, with a white patch on his chest. He has no collar that I could see, and he [pause] I'm sorry, I [inaudible] the water [line breaks up] is that better? I believe my telephone went underwater for a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hear you now. You said no collar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. No collar. He has been wandering about since the storm ended, the one from Friday into Saturday. He looks thin and frightened, and I worry he will be struck by a car, or that he may frighten someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is he aggressive at all, or just wandering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:52:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He has not been aggressive. He keeps his distance when I open the door. But he is hungry, I think, and I do not wish to approach him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart, don't approach him. Which street are you on? I need a location for the officer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh dear, I would rather not give it over the telephone just now. Might the officer call me instead? My number is 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0165. I'll put in the dog's description and have someone call you back today. If he gets aggressive or goes into traffic, call the police right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:53:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you ever so much. Kindly tell them I am worried about him."
    }
  ],
